BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Repair Cafe Toronto
DTSTART:20271120T160000Z
DTEND:20271120T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T042031Z
UID:c1cfbe82-d12b-4641-a558-19e107e8ff85
SEQUENCE:12
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:CNIB Bayview
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DESCRIPTION:The CNIB Repair Café runs from 11 AM to 2 PM\, the venue is to
  be decided closer to the date. We repair appliances\, sewing\, computers 
 and jewelry\, we also repair accessibility devices such as Perkins braille
 rs\, white canes\, electronic magnifiers\, talking and braille watches\, 
 and sewing-related repairs. The Repair Café does not charge for repairs\,
  it is free! We encourage individuals to RSVP in advance to secure priorit
 y for repairs\, although walk-ins are also welcome. The Repair Café at th
 e CNIB Bayview is usually held every two months on the third Saturday. For
  further details or inquiries\, please feel free to contact Dom at Dom.Ch
 an@cnib.ca.
CATEGORIES:Midi Event
URL:https://repaircafetoronto.ca/rc-events/cnib-gta-hub-7-2-2-2-2-2/
END:VEVENT
