SUMMARY:Wexford Mini Repair Café
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:Scarborough Citadel Child Care – 2021 Lawrence Ave E\, Scarborou
 gh\, ON M1R 2Z2\, Canada
DESCRIPTION:Hi! Join our Repair Café on September 19th from 10am to 1pm. T
 he goal of repair cafes is to promote reuse and repair instead of wasting 
 resources. The event will be organized in Wexford at the Scarborough Citad
 el at 2021 Lawrence Ave. East and will invite neighbours to bring their cl
 othes\, small appliances and jewellery to be repaired. We are looking for 
 volunteers to help us sew and repair clothes as well as small appliances. 
 If you want to help\, contact us please! Registration ends at 12:30. Looki
 ng forward to seeing you there! The Scarborough Zero Waste Team!
GEO:43.745087;-79.2950581
CATEGORIES:Mini Event
URL:https://repaircafetoronto.ca/rc-events/wexford-mini-repair-cafe-10/
